#       take effect and you are running the flat gates this profile exists to replace.
#   [ ] Boot log shows "thresholds are LOT-RELATIVE". A warning that they are FLAT means the same.
#   [ ] GET /api/box/universe → `summary.watched` ≈ 150, `eligible_not_watched` = 0,
#       `blocked_by_caps` understood (each one is a name that can never trade at these caps).
#   [ ] One full paper_legging session reviewed; §15 tuned against real counters.
#   [ ] ZERODHA_STATIC_IP_CONFIRMED=true, and the address really is registered with Zerodha.
#   [ ] §8 switched to live, §9 mode (A)/(B) chosen deliberately.
#   [ ] Panic path known: POST /api/box/live/flatten.
